  "files": [
    {
      "path": "index.html",
      "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Pixel Calculator</title>\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"styles.css\">\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1>Pixel Calculator</h1>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"left\">Left number</label>\n      <input id=\"left\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. -3.5\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"right\">Right number</label>\n      <input id=\"right\" type=\"text\" inputmode=\"decimal\" placeholder=\"e.g. 2\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"field\">\n      <label for=\"operation\">Operation</label>\n      <select id=\"operation\">\n        <option value=\"add\">Add (+)</option>\n        <option value=\"subtract\">Subtract (−)</option>\n        <option value=\"multiply\">Multiply (×)</option>\n        <option value=\"divide\">Divide (÷)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    <button id=\"calculate\" type=\"button\">Calculate</button>\n    <output id=\"result\" for=\"left right operation\">0</output>\n  </main>\n  <script src=\"script.js\"></script>\n</body>\n</html>",
      "description": "Main HTML structure with required IDs and labels"
    },
    {
      "path": "styles.css",
      "content": ":root {\n  --bg: #1a1c2c;\n  --card: #2d2f45;\n  --text: #f4f4f4;\n  --accent: #ffcd75;\n  --accent-dark: #e0a800;\n  --error: #ff6b6b;\n  --border: #5a5c7a;\n}\n\n* { box-sizing: border-box; }\n\nbody {\n  margin: 0;\n  min-height: 100vh;\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  justify-content: center;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif;\n  font-size: 18px;\n  color: var(--text);\n  padding: 16px;\n}\n\n.card {\n  background: var(--card);\n  padding: 28px 24px;\n  border: 4px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  box-shadow: 8px 8px 0 rgba(0,0,0,0.4);\n  width: 100%;\n  max-width: 380px;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 18px;\n}\n\nh1 {\n  margin: 0 0 6px;\n  font-size: 24px;\n  text-align: center;\n  letter-spacing: 2px;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\n.field {\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: column;\n  gap: 6px;\n}\n\nlabel {\n  font-size: 16px;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  color: var(--accent);\n}\n\ninput, select {\n  font: inherit;\n  padding: 10px 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--text);\n  outline: none;\n  transition: border-color 0.15s, box-shadow 0.15s;\n}\n\ninput:focus, select:focus {\n  border-color: var(--accent);\n  box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(255,205,117,0.3);\n}\n\nbutton {\n  font: inherit;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 12px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--accent-dark);\n  border-radius: 0;\n  background: var(--accent);\n  color: var(--bg);\n  cursor: pointer;\n  transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.05s;\n  text-transform: uppercase;\n  letter-spacing: 1px;\n}\n\nbutton:hover { background: var(--accent-dark); }\nbutton:focus-visible { outline: 3px solid var(--text); outline-offset: 2px; }\nbutton:active { transform: translate(2px, 2px); }\n\noutput {\n  display: block;\n  text-align: center;\n  font-size: 28px;\n  font-weight: 700;\n  padding: 14px;\n  border: 3px solid var(--border);\n  background: var(--bg);\n  color: var(--accent);\n  word-break: break-all;\n  min-height: 60px;\n}\n\noutput.error { color: var(--error); }\n\n@media (max-width: 360px) {\n  body { padding: 8px; }\n  .card { padding: 20px 16px; gap: 14px; }\n  h1 { font-size: 20px; }\n  output { font-size: 24px; }\n}",
      "description": "Pixel-style theme and responsive layout"
    },
    {
      "path": "script.js",
      "content": "(function () {\n  'use strict';\n\n  var left = document.getElementById('left');\n  var right = document.getElementById('right');\n  var operation = document.getElementById('operation');\n  var calculate = document.getElementById('calculate');\n  var result = document.getElementById('result');\n\n  function showError() {\n    result.textContent = 'Error';\n    result.classList.add('error');\n  }\n\n  function showValue(value) {\n    result.textContent = String(value);\n    result.classList.remove('error');\n  }\n\n  function parseNumber(input) {\n    var raw = input.value.trim();\n    if (raw === '') return NaN;\n    var num = Number(raw);\n    return isFinite(num) ? num : NaN;\n  }\n\n  function compute() {\n    var a = parseNumber(left);\n    var b = parseNumber(right);\n    if (isNaN(a) || isNaN(b)) {\n      showError();\n      return;\n    }\n    var op = operation.value;\n    var out;\n    if (op === 'add') {\n      out = a + b;\n    } else if (op === 'subtract') {\n      out = a - b;\n    } else if (op === 'multiply') {\n      out = a * b;\n    } else if (op === 'divide') {\n      if (b === 0) {\n        showError();\n        return;\n      }\n      out = a / b;\n    } else {\n      showError();\n      return;\n    }\n    if (!isFinite(out)) {\n      showError();\n      return;\n    }\n    showValue(out);\n  }\n\n  calculate.addEventListener('click', compute);\n\n  [left, right, operation].forEach(function (el) {\n    el.addEventListener('keydown', function (e) {\n      if (e.key === 'Enter') {\n        e.preventDefault();\n        compute();\n      }\n    });\n  });\n})();",
      "description": "Validation and calculation logic"
    },
    {
      "path": "README.md",
      "content": "# Pixel Two-Number Calculator\n\nA retro pixel-styled calculator that performs basic arithmetic on two numbers.\n\n## Features\n\n- Inputs: `left` and `right` (support negative and decimal values)\n- Operation selector: add, subtract, multiply, divide\n- Calculate button (`calculate`)\n- Output (`result`) shows only the numeric result, initialized to `0`\n- Invalid input (empty, non-finite) or division by zero displays exactly `Error`\n- Keyboard accessible: labels, focus states, Enter to calculate\n- Fully responsive from 360px wide\n- Offline: no packages, storage, network requests, or external assets\n\n## Usage\n\n1. Open `index.html` in any modern browser.\n2. Enter a number in each input field.\n3. Choose an operation from the dropdown.\n4. Click **Calculate** (or press Enter in an input).\n5. The result appears in the output box.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` – structure and required IDs\n- `styles.css` – pixel-style theme and responsive layout\n- `script.js` – validation and calculation logic\n\n## Limitations\n\n- No history or memory functions.\n- Very large results may display in scientific notation.\n- Division by zero and invalid inputs intentionally show `Error`.",
